<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1609561313"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:12.155"><div begin="16.103" end="44.878" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="16.103" end="21.906" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.103" end="16.854">时光如</span><span begin="16.854" end="17.232">水</span><span begin="17.380" end="18.778">点点滴</span><span begin="18.778" end="19.025">滴</span> <span begin="19.231" end="19.715">多温</span><span begin="19.715" end="21.029">柔的年</span><span begin="21.029" end="21.906">纪</span></p><p begin="23.547" end="29.204" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.547" end="24.332">翩翩少</span><span begin="24.332" end="24.643">年</span><span begin="24.719" end="26.056">踏歌而</span><span begin="26.056" end="26.409">行</span> <span begin="26.563" end="27.084">像寻</span><span begin="27.084" end="27.807">光的</span><span begin="27.807" end="28.410">飞</span><span begin="28.410" end="29.204">鸟</span></p><p begin="30.239" end="36.485" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.239" end="30.727">曾一</span><span begin="30.727" end="31.680">路狂</span><span begin="31.680" end="32.051">奔</span> <span begin="32.051" end="33.869">手舞足蹈</span> <span begin="34.181" end="34.489">轻</span><span begin="34.489" end="35.733">扬着嘴</span><span begin="35.733" end="36.485">角</span></p><p begin="37.684" end="41.177" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.684" end="38.127">不辜</span><span begin="38.127" end="38.626">负</span><span begin="38.626" end="38.876">一</span><span begin="38.876" end="39.552">毫</span> <span begin="39.552" end="40.915">每分每</span><span begin="40.915" end="41.177">秒</span></p><p begin="41.367" end="44.878" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.367" end="42.697">让每颗自由的</span><span begin="42.697" end="43.019">心</span> <span begin="43.191" end="44.333">放声</span><span begin="44.333" end="44.599">欢</span><span begin="44.599" end="44.878">笑</span></p></div><div begin="45.069" end="1:13.975" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="45.069" end="51.480" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.069" end="45.583">我无</span><span begin="45.583" end="45.852">比</span><span begin="45.852" end="48.223">庆幸此刻年</span><span begin="48.223" end="48.736">少</span> <span begin="48.937" end="49.215">青</span><span begin="49.215" end="50.491">春正燃</span><span begin="50.491" end="51.480">烧</span></p><p begin="52.423" end="59.135" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.423" end="52.938">哪怕</span><span begin="52.938" end="53.289">这</span><span begin="53.289" end="54.334">明天</span><span begin="54.334" end="55.685">一路飘</span><span begin="55.685" end="56.035">摇</span> <span begin="56.194" end="56.657">也挥</span><span begin="56.657" end="57.979">舞着骄</span><span begin="57.979" end="59.135">傲</span></p><p begin="59.829" end="1:06.492" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.829" end="1:00.320">我无</span><span begin="1:00.320" end="1:01.077">比清</span><span begin="1:01.077" end="1:01.676">醒</span><span begin="1:01.676" end="1:03.087">梦远天</span><span begin="1:03.087" end="1:03.508">高</span> <span begin="1:03.683" end="1:03.973">却</span><span begin="1:03.973" end="1:04.473">执</span><span begin="1:04.473" end="1:05.356">意得</span><span begin="1:05.356" end="1:06.492">到</span></p><p begin="1:07.212" end="1:13.975" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.212" end="1:07.721">愿再</span><span begin="1:07.721" end="1:08.525">会如</span><span begin="1:08.525" end="1:09.089">期</span><span begin="1:09.089" end="1:10.777">不远万里</span> <span begin="1:11.115" end="1:11.555">问</span><span begin="1:11.555" end="1:11.870">近</span><span begin="1:11.870" end="1:12.253">来</span><span begin="1:12.533" end="1:12.744">可</span><span begin="1:12.744" end="1:13.975">好</span></p></div><div begin="1:31.817" end="2:01.347" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:31.817" end="1:37.721" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.817" end="1:32.625">梦外下</span><span begin="1:32.625" end="1:32.943">雨</span><span begin="1:33.048" end="1:34.376">梦中繁</span><span b